{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962040/extras/bb2efbfa5dab33552cd8a678d6f6d26f.poster.avif?t=1771849162\" width=560 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962040/extras/bb2efbfa5dab33552cd8a678d6f6d26f.webm?t=1771849162\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962040/extras/bb2efbfa5dab33552cd8a678d6f6d26f.mp4?t=1771849162\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Ranchbound you take charge of your own ranch. You run a cattle operation, looking after the health and growth of your herd as it expands in size and value. Hire cowboys and assign their duties: from herding and caretaking to defending against threats. As your herd grows, so do your options.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962040/extras/364e0c4deddb70ba448c63518761d5bc.poster.avif?t=1771849162\" width=560 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962040/extras/364e0c4deddb70ba448c63518761d5bc.webm?t=1771849162\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962040/extras/364e0c4deddb70ba448c63518761d5bc.mp4?t=1771849162\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world around you is alive - towns, traders, natives, and the military form a complex web of ties and dependencies. You can invest in local ventures to build your standing in the Wild West while expanding your own homestead. But these wild lands are also a place of rivalry - for land, influence, and wealth. Each day brings new challenges, and only those who can fight hard will endure.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow your herd: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the first calves to mature cattle that become the foundation of your fortune.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hire cowboys:  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assign tasks and watch them ride, drive the herd, and keep it safe.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand your ranch:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade buildings and facilities to turn a modest homestead into a thriving estate.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build economic influence: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy land, invest in railroads and other local ventures to expand your power in the Wild West.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shape relations: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your decisions define your standing with towns, natives, and the military.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survival elements:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s not just about supplies - take care of your crew\u2019s condition and morale to face the challenges of the frontier.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From a humble homestead to a powerhouse - make sure the Wild West hears your name!</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3962040?t=1771849162","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3962040?t=1771849162","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962040/c7d8951d45f8688fd1734c67fc852c5ba21f8040/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771849162","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962040/c7d8951d45f8688fd1734c67fc852c5ba21f8040/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771849162","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3973030,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962040/extras/bb2efbfa5dab33552cd8a678d6f6d26f.poster.avif?t=1771849162\" width=560 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962040/extras/bb2efbfa5dab33552cd8a678d6f6d26f.webm?t=1771849162\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962040/extras/bb2efbfa5dab33552cd8a678d6f6d26f.mp4?t=1771849162\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Ranchbound you take charge of your own ranch. You run a cattle operation, looking after the health and growth of your herd as it expands in size and value. Hire cowboys and assign their duties: from herding and caretaking to defending against threats. As your herd grows, so do your options.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962040/extras/364e0c4deddb70ba448c63518761d5bc.poster.avif?t=1771849162\" width=560 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962040/extras/364e0c4deddb70ba448c63518761d5bc.webm?t=1771849162\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962040/extras/364e0c4deddb70ba448c63518761d5bc.mp4?t=1771849162\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world around you is alive - towns, traders, natives, and the military form a complex web of ties and dependencies. You can invest in local ventures to build your standing in the Wild West while expanding your own homestead. But these wild lands are also a place of rivalry - for land, influence, and wealth. Each day brings new challenges, and only those who can fight hard will endure.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow your herd: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the first calves to mature cattle that become the foundation of your fortune.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hire cowboys:  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assign tasks and watch them ride, drive the herd, and keep it safe.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand your ranch:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade buildings and facilities to turn a modest homestead into a thriving estate.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build economic influence: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy land, invest in railroads and other local ventures to expand your power in the Wild West.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shape relations: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your decisions define your standing with towns, natives, and the military.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survival elements:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s not just about supplies - take care of your crew\u2019s condition and morale to face the challenges of the frontier.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From a humble homestead to a powerhouse - make sure the Wild West hears your name!</p></li></ul>","developers":["Eldersong Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3962040/cf57273726b51c966aac108eaae9d4edf6f66721/header.jpg?t=1771849162","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":